#### How it works

We would love to hear from you and see how we can support your decision in Red Barn.

-   **Intro Call (15 min)** – Share your goals, confirm fit, and outline next steps.
    
-   **Discovery (Week 1)** – Quick intake + values quiz to set direction.
    
-   **Plan & Implement (Weeks 2–4)** – We design your portfolio and execute under a discretionary mandate.
